"If you or your company wants to be listed here please email "
"partners@ardupilot.org. To be added to this page we request the applicant "
"has made a contribution to ArduPilot or a related project in some way. This "
"includes code, documentation or helping people on the forums. The intention "
"with this policy is to ensure that companies listed here will be active "
"participants in the community."
